{"strings": [
  {"text":"The Fall of the House of Usher","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/game.json title"},
  {"text":"Summoned by a desperate letter, you come to Roderick Usher. A house by a dark tarn, a fissure down its front, his sister Madeline like a shadow. Something is ending here — and you will be beside him when it does.","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/game.json description"},
  {"text":"An old friend calls you to a house that seems to share its masters' sickness.","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/game.json line"},
  {"text":"after the tale by Edgar Allan Poe","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/game.json source"},
  {"text":"Vacant, eye-like windows. So vast a house — and but two to dwell in it.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Old trees. Dead ones — nothing more.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Black water. A still and silent tarn.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"I thank you…","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Yes. It is better so.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Silence. I thank you.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Do not… The light is torture to my eyes.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Shut it! The wind — it shrieks.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Each stroke — like a nail.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The arrival","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The tarn","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"into the water","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"ride on","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"His chamber","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"his way","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"my way","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Madeline passes","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"follow her","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"stay with him","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Her plea","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"— I promise","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"say nothing","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"I know not how it was — but, with the first glimpse of the building, a sense of insufferable gloom pervaded my spirit.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"A barely perceptible fissure. From the roof down to the very water.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Into the water","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Ride on","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"In the reflection, at an upper window, someone stood. I raised my eyes — the window was vacant.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"You have come. I had thought that no one would come again.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"I scarcely knew him. A cadaverousness of complexion, an eye large and luminous, hair of a more than web-like softness.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Forgive me. The light is torture to my eyes. Every sound — a blow.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"I came to live by his rules. It was easier so — for him.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Madeline. My sister. We are twins.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"She is ill. At times she grows rigid — as one dead. Then she comes to herself again.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Follow her","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Stay with him","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"We have ever felt each other. When she suffers — I suffer.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The physicians know not what it is. One day she will grow rigid — and not awaken.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"She stood fixed in mid-step. She did not breathe. Her eyes were open.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"When I am so — I hear everything. Do not let them shut me in.","who":"madeline","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"I promise","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Say nothing","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"I promise.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Madeline will remember this.","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"I never beheld her living again.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Days","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"His music","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"follow him","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"my own time","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The physician","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"tell him of it","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The physician’s carriage","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"stay","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"leave","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The walk","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"to the shore","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"back","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"For several days ensuing, her name was unmentioned.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Speak not of her. I beg you.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Her song. She sang it when we were children.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Then he sang — of a palace into which, one day, madness entered.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"He sang of himself.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"In the gallery I met the family physician.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"A most curious case. When she… I should like to study her.","who":"doctor","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Tell him","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I told him how she grows rigid.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Catalepsy… Exquisite.","who":"doctor","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I leave in the morning. There is room in my carriage.","who":"doctor","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Stay","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Leave with him","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Leave","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"No. Stay","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"To go — and leave him alone.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"For many years he had not ventured forth. I led him out by the hand.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I had forgotten the smell of the air.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I shall perish. Not of the evil itself — of the terror of it.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"This house lives. The stones, the tarn. They have made us what we are.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"To the shore","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Back","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I led him on, to the shore.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"At the very brink he fell to his knees and stopped his ears.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I turned back.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"She is no more.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The vault","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"At the coffin","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"touch her hand","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"the mirror","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"do not touch","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"The lid","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“she may be living”","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“do not close it”","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"The screws","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"screw it down","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"leave them loose","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"A sound below","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"go down","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"tell him","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“only the wind”","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Morning","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"For a fortnight she shall lie below, in a vault. The physicians are too eager in their inquiries. And the burial-ground is remote.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"You spoke with him. He will come for her. So it must be today.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"A faint blush upon the face. Upon the bosom. And that lingering smile upon the lip which is so terrible in death.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Touch her hand","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Mirror to lips","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Do not touch","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"The hand was warm.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"The mirror remained unclouded.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"So it is with her malady. She may be living. There is no knowing for certain.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"We are twins. I would have felt it.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"May be living","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Do not close","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"She may be living.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"I know. I dread it more than her death.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Wait. Do not close it.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"This is my house.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"The screws. Help me.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"He tried the screws. And drove them home himself.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Close the door","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Some days passed. He roamed the house by night. Sleep came not near my couch.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"From below, through the stone — her song. Before, I should not have heard it.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"From below — scarcely to be heard — as of something scratching at wood.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Lamplight passed beneath the door. It paused. It went on.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Into the vault","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Go to him","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Only the wind","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"It is the wind. Only the wind.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"I found him in the dark, against the wall.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"You hear it too?","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"We stood and listened. Together.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"From within, there came an answer.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"In the morning I asked him for the key.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"I cast the key into the tarn. Else I should have opened — and seen her eyes.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"In the morning my horse stood saddled. I might yet depart.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"The storm","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The window","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"close it","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"watch with him","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The reading","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"louder","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"listen","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Hands","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"hers","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"his","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"both","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"neither","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"And you have not seen it?","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Close the window","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Watch with him","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"To divert him, I took up an antique romance of the knight Ethelred, and read it aloud.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Each sound of which I read found its echo in the house.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"We have put her living in the tomb! I have heard her — many, many days — yet I dared not speak!","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"And you heard it.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You would have spoken — I would not let you.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You left the screws loose. I knew it.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You knocked at her door by night. Again and again. And she answered.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"I cast the key into the tarn — lest I should open it.","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Madman! I tell you that she now stands without the door!","who":"roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"I could not take my eyes away.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"As in Poe","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The deep and dank tarn at my feet closed sullenly and silently over the fragments of the House of Usher.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Madeline","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"She lives. She speaks no word. She stands by the water, and hums her song.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"I know not whether I saved her.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Roderick","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"He lives. Of her he does not speak. He sits by the water — and listens still.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Both","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The house went down beneath the water. But that which came out of it with them — did not.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Stayed","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The tarn closed over the House of Usher. Over them. And over me.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Rode away","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A month later there came a letter: the House of Usher was no more. It had gone down into the tarn on the night of the storm.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"I read his letter once again.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Epilogue","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"My friend,\nI am ill in body, and more grievously still in mind: a malady that has no name oppresses me. The house has grown too still, and I hear all things in it.\nYou are my only friend.\nCome. Your society alone may yet bring me some alleviation. Do not delay.","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"You are my only friend.","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Roderick Usher","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Prologue","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"If you keep it, the chapters after this one will have to be played again.","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Drop the replay","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Keep","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Undo","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Continue the replay","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Back to the main run","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Continue","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Start","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Replay the chapter","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Replay from here","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"The author’s map","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"continue\nthe game","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"start\nthe game","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"The end","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Replay","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/map.js"},
  {"text":"continue\nthe replay","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/map.js"},
  {"text":"the author","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/map.js"},
  {"text":"For many years he had not ventured forth, and he balked at every step","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/by-the-hand.js"},
  {"text":"Nothing in the house accounted for the gloom it cast upon me","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/cause.js"},
  {"text":"From the very roof down the wall ran a barely perceptible fissure","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/cause.js"},
  {"text":"The causeway crumbled behind me, and the house sank beneath the water","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/flight.js"},
  {"text":"The house shook, and hands reached out to me","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/hands.js"},
  {"text":"The house shook, and their hands reached out to each other","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/hands.js"},
  {"text":"The iron door was locked, and beyond it all was still","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/knock.js"},
  {"text":"From there, from beyond the door, came an answer","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/knock.js"},
  {"text":"Walk away","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/knock.js"},
  {"text":"From below, through the stone, there came some sound","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/listening.js"},
  {"text":"Dim them","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/quieter.js"},
  {"text":"Light more","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/quieter.js"},
  {"text":"Draw the curtain","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/quieter.js"},
  {"text":"Open the window","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/quieter.js"},
  {"text":"Stop the clock","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/quieter.js"},
  {"text":"Wind the clock","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/quieter.js"},
  {"text":"Every ray and every sound gave him pain","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/quieter.js"},
  {"text":"And Ethelred, who was by nature of a doughty heart, uplifted his mace and smote upon the plankings of the hermit’s door,","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/reading.js"},
  {"text":"so that the noise of the dry and hollow-sounding wood, ripped all asunder, alarummed and reverberated throughout the forest.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/reading.js"},
  {"text":"But he found there no hermit, but in the stead thereof a dragon of a fiery tongue, and smote it;","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/reading.js"},
  {"text":"and the dragon fell, and gave up his pesty breath with a shriek so horrid and harsh that Ethelred had fain to close his ears with his hands.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/reading.js"},
  {"text":"And Ethelred approached valorously over the silver pavement to where the brazen shield was upon the wall; which in sooth tarried not for his full coming —","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/reading.js"},
  {"text":"but fell down at his feet upon the silver floor, with a mighty great and terrible ringing sound.","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/reading.js"},
  {"text":"I read aloud to him an antique romance of the knight Ethelred","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/reading.js"},
  {"text":"Read louder","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/reading.js"},
  {"text":"Listen","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/reading.js"},
  {"text":"Do not let them shut me in.","who":"madeline","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/screws.js"},
  {"text":"Four screws held the lid down over her","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/screws.js"},
  {"text":"Leave it so","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/screws.js"},
  {"text":"He played ever faster, and the music bore him away","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/minigames/string.js"},
  {"text":"I","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/people.json.narrator short"},
  {"text":"the physician","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/people.json.doctor short"},
  {"text":"The fissure widens","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The fissure is quiet","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The fissure widens when the truth goes unspoken here.","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Reason ↑","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Reason ↓","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The lower your reason, the more you see and hear.","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Roderick ↑","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Roderick ↓","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Roderick ↑ — he trusts you more, ↓ — less.","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Madeline heard that.","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"U","context":"the seal: Usher’s initial","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/ui.js"},
  {"text":"fold","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/ui.js"},
  {"text":"unfold","translation":"","where":"games/fall-of-the-house-of-usher/bespoke/ui.js"}
]}
